==Battleground==
*8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[LeMurr]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have made it this far, then [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] should be able to stall the Bun Bun Symbiote. Money shouldn't be too much of an issue thanks to a consistent supply of peons giving you cash, but it will be difficult to build a stack of units thanks to the Devil Wives consistently clearing your front lines. Use disposable attackers such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to deal massive amounts of damage to the Bun Bun Symbiote in order to clear it as quickly as possible. Use midranges like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] to handle the Aku Gories which will be the main pushers aside from Bun Bun.

